            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Mosaic 2.3.3</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Export and import settings for all accounts, including column layouts, widths, titles, filters, appearance, and update preferences.</li>
  <li>Import matches accounts already configured on this Mac and saves a backup before applying changes. Newly added accounts need a one-time sign-in; login credentials are not exported.</li>
  <li>Fixed clickwheel mouse scrolling that could move the column frame without scrolling its content.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
